  "title": "BLT",
  "subtitle": "Bacon, lettuce, and tomato sandwich",
  "excerpt": "A BLT is a bacon, lettuce, and tomato sandwich on toasted bread with mayonnaise. It sounds simple and it is, but the quality of each element matters: crisp bacon, ripe tomatoes, fresh crisp lettuce, good mayonnaise, and properly toasted bread. It is one of the great American sandwiches.",
