    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A BLT is assembled, not cooked. The only cooking is frying the bacon. The rest is selection and assembly. Use the best tomatoes you can find: a BLT made with a ripe in-season tomato is completely different from one made with a supermarket tomato in December. Season the tomato slices with salt before they go into the sandwich."
          }
        ]
      },
